  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"1184\">\n<li data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"1014\">\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"1014\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"851\">Positive</strong>: Suggests presence of <strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"892\">autoantibodies</strong> linked to <strong data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"961\">systemic sclerosis (especially diffuse cutaneous form)</strong>. Often associated with <strong data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1013\">scleroderma renal crisis</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1184\">\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1184\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1029\">Negative</strong>: No detectable RNA Polymerase III antibodies. Does not rule out systemic sclerosis; other antibodies (e.g., anti-Scl-70, anti-centromere) may be involved.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1340\">\n<p data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1340\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1197\">Note:</strong> Part of an autoimmune connective tissue disease workup. Always interpret in correlation with clinical findings and other autoantibody results.</span></p>\n</blockquote>",
